  "about": "Expected result-block values for the Buoyane rehearsal ROM, the five check ROMs and the release ROM's auto QA run, judged by tools/judge.py. Block layout: arm9/source/game/rehearsal.h; the scenes are in arm9/source/judge/lightcheck.c. \"frame\" is the minimum number of frames to run, per boot. Every scene item names the capture it depends on (\"done\": values[0] bit of its scene). \"known\" lists, per emulator version and renderer, the gating items expected to fail there; judge.py --profile passes only when the failing set matches exactly. Expected values come from GBATEK; wire-texture-alpha is the one item whose expected value is the console's (hw:dslite-ntr): GBATEK says otherwise. The Equal band position, the decal holes and the +-1 step plane (values[10], [11], [13], [18]) are recorded in the block but not judged; they and the fog alpha glitch are research probe items (probes/).",
